"- Inner Bottle Wall\n    - Attribute 1 Type - smooth, curved interior surface of a bottle\n    - Attribute 2 Color - dark brown with subtle amber highlights from reflected light\n    - Attribute 3 Size - circular, with inner diameter approximately matching the bottle's neck opening; outer diameter slightly larger due to curvature\n    - Attribute 4 Material - glass\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - transparent glass with slight tint, showing reflections and refractions\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - one continuous inner wall\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - forms the inner boundary of the bottle neck opening, surrounding the central aperture\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - concentrically curved inward, facing the central aperture\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - seamlessly connected to the glass rim and encloses the central aperture\n\n- Glass Rim\n    - Attribute 1 Type - thick, rounded edge of the bottle neck\n    - Attribute 2 Color - dark brown with golden-orange reflective highlights along its upper edge\n    - Attribute 3 Size - circular, with a consistent width that tapers slightly inward toward the inner bottle wall\n    - Attribute 4 Material - glass\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - glass with slight texture and reflective properties, showing light refraction\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - one continuous rim\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - positioned at the outermost edge of the bottle neck, surrounding the inner bottle wall\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - circular, oriented horizontally, facing outward\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - attached to the inner bottle wall and encloses the central aperture\n\n- Bottle Neck Opening\n    - Attribute 1 Type - cylindrical opening at the top of the bottle neck\n    - Attribute 2 Color - dark brown with golden-orange reflective highlights along the rim\n    - Attribute 3 Size - circular, with diameter matching the inner bottle wall and glass rim\n    - Attribute 4 Material - glass\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - transparent glass with slight tint, showing reflections and refractions\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - one opening\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - at the top of the bottle neck, surrounded by the glass rim and inner bottle wall\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - circular, facing upward\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - connected to the inner bottle wall and glass rim, forming the boundary of the central aperture\n\n- Central Aperture\n    - Attribute 1 Type - circular void at the center of the bottle neck opening\n    - Attribute 2 Color - deep black, appearing void-like due to lack of light reflection\n    - Attribute 3 Size - circular, with diameter smaller than the inner bottle wall and glass rim\n    - Attribute 4 Material - air or empty space within the bottle\n    - Attribute 5 Composition - empty space, surrounded by glass\n    - Attribute 6 Quantity - one aperture\n    - Attribute 7 Relative Location - centered within the bottle neck opening, enclosed by the inner bottle wall and glass rim\n    - Attribute 8 Orientation - circular, facing upward\n    - Attribute 9 Connection or Attachments - surrounded by the inner bottle wall and glass rim, forming the innermost boundary of the bottle neck opening"